# Auxiliary Boosters {4}{W} (Black Lotus' WWW, Mox Pearl, Mox Sapphire): "When this Equipment enters, create a 2/2 colorless Robot artifact
# creature token and attach this Equipment to it" (CR 111.1, 701.3a). "Equipped creature gets +1/+2 and has flying": the Robot is a 3/4
# flier, where Bot1's unequipped Memnite is a 1/1. Turn 3: Equip {3} (Mox Jet, Mox Ruby, Mox Emerald) is not paid by two sources, and
# when paid moves the Equipment onto the Memnite (2/3 flying) as a sorcery, leaving the Robot a plain 2/2 without flying.

